message: "If you use bGMO data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Bangladesh Ground Motion Observatory (bGMO): PS-InSAR ground motion for the cities of Bangladesh"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
authors:
  - family-names: "Islam"
    given-names: "Towhidul"
    affiliation: "SAR.Sense Geointelligence Lab"
  - name: "SAR.Sense Geointelligence Lab"
url: "https://bgmo.sarsense.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TowhidulIslam27/bGMO"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - InSAR
  - PS-InSAR
  - Sentinel-1
  - land subsidence
  - ground motion
  - Bangladesh
abstract: >-
  Interactive map and processing code for PS-InSAR ground motion in Dhaka,
  Chattogram, Khulna, Barishal, Sylhet and Cumilla from Sentinel-1 (2016-2024),
  with line-of-sight velocities and time series for ascending and descending
  tracks, and a combined vertical and east-west product on a 100 m grid.
  Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel-1 data (2016-2024).
